  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Action to End Gender-Based Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Programme will enable Civil Society Organisations, especially Women&apos;s Rights Organisations, Women-led Movements and those representing the most marginalised groups, to play a central role in delivering survivor-centred and demand-driven initiatives to prevent and respond to Gender Based Violence. It will be implemented by the UN Trust Fund to End Violence Against Women.</narrative>
  </description>
